== Attacks and abilities ==
{{For|strategies for defeating Dvergr|Aggressive creature strategies#Dvergr}}

=== Shoot ===
Lifts one leg to support and load their crossbow before shooting the player (110 [[Damage types#Pierce|Pierce]] damage). The arrow travels at 40 meters per second for up to 4 seconds before despawning and has a spread of 2–20 degrees. This attack can be used every 6 seconds when within 1–15 meters of a player.

=== Melee ===
Smacks the player with the side of their crossbow (70 [[Damage types#Blunt|Blunt]] damage). This attack swings in a 2.5-meter 90-degree horizontal arc and can be used every 4 seconds when within 0.5–2.5 meters of a player.

